---
source: tests/workflow.rs
expression: cli.checkpoint()
---
$ markoff add --section Work
work
$ markoff add --section home
home
$ markoff add work 'Fix login bug' --body '- [ ] reproduce'
work/fix-login-bug
$ echo "Start with the CLI.\n" | markoff add work 'Write docs' --body -
work/write-docs
$ markoff add home 'Water plants `* * *`'
home/water-plants
$ markoff add home 'Call Bob' --before home/water-plants
home/call-bob
$ markoff list
# Tasks

## work
- Fix login bug (work/fix-login-bug)
- Write docs (work/write-docs)

## home
- Call Bob (home/call-bob)
- Water plants `* * *` (home/water-plants)

